# [MOQ](../wg/moq.html)

## Summary

The MOQ Working Group held an interim virtual meeting on September 21, 2026. The session focused on scheduling and planning for the upcoming hybrid interim in Seattle, defining the next interoperability target draft for `draft-ietf-moq-transport`, and resolving key technical issues in the transport specification. Major technical discussions centered on location filter serialization, pausing semantics, the validity of empty namespaces/tuples, and the proposed "switch from" mechanism.

---

## Key Discussion Points

### Working Group Logistics and Milestones
Martin Duke presented the [Chair Slides](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/interim-2026-moq-24/materials/slides-interim-2026-moq-24-sessa-chair-slides-00) and outlined key deadlines:
